From: Justin <justurn@live.com>
Date: Tue, 7 Jul 2026 14:32:23 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat: F-194 Cata zone phasing progression (PhaseMgr backport)

- Backport TrinityCore 4.3.4 PhaseMgr (definition-driven, server-side phasemask) from
  Project Neltharion. Per-zone ordered phase_definitions gated by CONDITION_SOURCE_TYPE_PHASE
  (26) on quest state; resolved phasemask applied via Player::SetPhaseMask.
- ObjectMgr: LoadPhaseDefinitions + store; ConditionMgr: enable source type 26 + accessor;
  Player: PhaseMgr member, recalc on zone change + quest reward/status change + login.
- Terrain swaps (terrainswapmap/phaseId) loaded but not applied (deferred until swap
  terrains are ported).

Co-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
